# An allowlist: upload only what the build needs. A CLI deploy from this
# checkout must never upload .env, private/ (tokens, keys, the league sheet,
# salary CSVs) or anything else that isn't the app. A Git deploy has none of
# those (they're gitignored), but it also skips tests, docs and scripts this way.
/*
!/app.py
!/src
!/pyproject.toml
!/uv.lock
!/.python-version
!/vercel.json
!/README.md
